<p>Primary documentation checked on 20 October 2026. Every schedule, listing and observed table was run on PostgreSQL 18.6 with default settings: Read Committed, <code>synchronous_commit = on</code>, <code>fsync = on</code>, <code>deadlock_timeout = 1s</code>. A script replays every schedule and checks each reply and final state. Figure 4’s row versions are a model; its waits and results were observed. The durability table is from the documentation and was not tested.</p>
